Here's how becoming a member works, start to finish.

- Apply with a short form.
- A keyholder reviews it and sets up an in-person tour.
- After the tour, one keyholder decides: yes or no.
- Say yes, and you agree to the membership terms. Then you're active.
- Money never enters that decision. Whoever reviews your application doesn't see what you've paid, or whether you've paid anything at all.
- Your email address and mailing-list status don't gate membership either. Those are always separate.
- Need a break? Pause, and pick back up later.
- Leaving is simple, and handled with dignity.
